referenceFunction.generalComment:
Manufacturing process is considered with consumption of raw materials, energy, as well as infrastructure and land use. Transport of the raw materials is included. No by-product is generated in the process. Auxiliaries, solid wastes, emissions to air and water (excepting emission of waste-heat) are not included due to the lack of data. Transport and storage of the final product are not included. Transcient or unstable operations are not considered, but the production during stable operation conditions. Inventory refers to 1 kg 100% amonium bicarbonate. Data for consumption of energy have been provided by a manufacturer. Consumption of raw materials is estimated on stoechiomtry assuming an efficiency of 95%. The literature source used is von Däniken et al. 1995.;
CAS number: 001066-33-7; 
Formula: NH5CO3; 
Synonyms: Ammoniumhydrogencarbonat, Doppeltkohlensaures Ammonium; 
UUID: dffd1400-7130-3d7d-8e16-1ff704ed6b6e
